stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> active: Platform — POST /v1/identifiers/{datasetId}<br/>(XSD valid → INSERT consignments + identifiers, status='active')

    [*] --> rejected: XSD invalid<br/>(JAXB throws → 400 INVALID_XML, no DB write)
    rejected --> [*]

    active --> active: Platform — POST /v1/identifiers/{datasetId}<br/>(re-upload — INSERT new consignments row sharing dataset_id;<br/>previous row remains, latest wins)

    active --> inactive: CronManager → POST /api/v1/admin/expire-identifiers<br/>mode='road' AND transport_date + 14 days < NOW()<br/>→ INSERT new consignments row with status='inactive'<br/>per Reg 2024/1942 Art 11(4) cabotage retention

    inactive --> active: rare — re-registration of same dataset_id<br/>(INSERT new row with status='active')

    active --> deleted: Platform — DELETE /v1/identifiers/{datasetId}<br/>(platform-initiated — mTLS-authenticated)<br/>→ INSERT new consignments row with status='deleted'
    active --> deleted: Admin — DELETE /api/v1/consignments/{datasetId}<br/>(operator-initiated)<br/>→ INSERT new consignments row with status='deleted'<br/>(logical delete — nothing physically removed)
    inactive --> deleted: Platform / Admin — DELETE<br/>→ INSERT new consignments row with status='deleted'

    note right of active
        consignments.status='active' (latest row).
        - Authority search returns this consignment.
        - Dataset XML retrievable via GET /v1/dataset/...
        - Indexed via consignments denormalised columns
          (vehicle_plate, vehicle_country, mode, …).
    end note

    note right of inactive
        consignments.status='inactive' (latest row).
        - Default authority search excludes (status=active).
        - Returned only with explicit status=inactive|all
          (cabotage queries: dateFrom/dateTo + status=inactive).
        - Dataset XML still retrievable via direct UIL.
    end note

    note right of deleted
        consignments.status='deleted' (latest row).
        - Logical delete: no row physically removed.
        - DELETE not granted to the runtime app role.
        - Excluded from all default queries (status=active filter).
        - Old (non-latest) rows archived nightly by CronManager (Epic 26).
    end note
